<mxCell id="pkg-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Independent processes&lt;/b&gt; share only data stores: capture and journaling (the owner), daily processing (20:00 / 06:00), weekly context refresh and the self-improvement cycle (daily extraction, weekly review). No sequence flow connects them. Every flow that can write to the vault first takes a snapshot (the scope comes from the vault policy); the owner can undo a run (Restore Run).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt; · yellow: isolated LLM session with category instruction · red: security element" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="pkg-La"><mxGeometry x="646" y="20" width="420" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pkg-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Pages (read in this order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Global Process Overview&lt;br&gt;2. Process Inbox Items&lt;br&gt;3. Process Learning Material (Open Notebook + local TTS)&lt;br&gt;4. Process Other Resource&lt;br&gt;5. Secure Fetch (reusable)&lt;br&gt;6. Run Category Sessions&lt;br&gt;7. Handle Security Flag&lt;br&gt;8. Refresh Project Contexts&lt;br&gt;9. Self-Improvement Cycle&lt;br&gt;10. System Tool Candidates&lt;br&gt;11. Wait for Generation Result&lt;br&gt;12. Restore Run&lt;br&gt;13. Describe Images" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="pkg-La"><mxGeometry x="646" y="165" width="420" height="215" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pkg-B1" value="Learning service: Open Notebook + local TTS (NotebookLM = fallback) – external black box" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="610" width="1110" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
