<mxCell id="pkl-n" value="&lt;b&gt;Design notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The Notebook-agent never sees the page content: it only gets the URL and the prompt template from config.&lt;br&gt;• Podcast generation is a separate step: local TTS is slower, so the timeout is configurable (e.g. 90 min).&lt;br&gt;• Switching to NotebookLM is a learning-gateway config change, the process stays the same.&lt;br&gt;• Wait for generation result is expanded on the page Wait for Generation Result (60 s polling)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="600" width="700" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
