<mxCell id="pko-B" value="Web search &amp;amp; fetch (MCP: SearXNG / Brave, Lightpanda) – external black box" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="540" width="1340" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pko-n" value="&lt;b&gt;Design notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Skills are replaced by per-category session plans in config: each session = fixed system prompt + category instruction in the user prompt.&lt;br&gt;• Secure fetch runs before the sessions when one of them reads the page; sessions only get the clean JSON extract. Misc reads only the INBOX note text (sessions without tools) and skips fetch.&lt;br&gt;• Output guard checks every plan's output (Misc included: the note text is untrusted) before it is written: a stored injection would attack every agent reading the vault later.&lt;br&gt;• Code decides: a new-category suggestion becomes an agent task only after the guard; no plan, no URL, a failed fetch or a failed session lists the item as failed with the reason." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="610" width="720" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
