<mxCell id="pkf-n" value="&lt;b&gt;Safe word → canary + authenticated instruction channel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A per-run random canary sits in the Reader&#x27;s system instruction. If it appears in any output, the item is stopped (prompt leak).&lt;br&gt;• Only text framed as &amp;lt;&amp;lt;SYS:token&amp;gt;&amp;gt; counts as instruction; page text is wrapped in random delimiters (datamarking).&lt;br&gt;• An override attempt is not executed: the Reader reports injection_suspected = true + evidence, and &#x27;Evaluate verdict&#x27; (code) raises the flag." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="560" width="780" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
