<mxCell id="pkc-n" value="&lt;b&gt;Context separation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Personal and enterprise contexts are separate files and separate sessions (Tool S3 / S4); the note keeps them in separate sections. Overlay categories (e.g. job search, business opportunities) live in a private config overlay and follow the same pattern.&lt;br&gt;• Enterprise context never leaves the machine: web-search queries pass a query guard (no client or project names).&lt;br&gt;• Instructions live in instructions/&amp;lt;category&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;session&amp;gt;.md and stay short (≈ ≤ 800 tokens) for the 9B model; they go into the user prompt, not into a long skill." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="760" width="860" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
