<mxCell id="pkr-n" value="no project notes (folder missing or empty) → empty pack with a warning; a vault server that is down fails the scope instead, and a failed scope never stops the other. The owner can edit a pack at any time (Obsidian, the config UI or a terminal): edits to the generated part are kept and the new version is proposed as contexts/personal.md.proposed (for example) with the diff in the vault (2-Areas/Context-Review); text below the manual marker is never rewritten." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="540" width="780" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
