<mxCell id="pks-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Privacy&lt;/b&gt; · journals are the most sensitive data: processed only by local sessions without tools, never sent to web search or the learning service, excluded from trace content capture, never part of the public repo. The agent only proposes; every status change except &#x27;proposed&#x27; needs the owner&#x27;s confirmation." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="720" width="560" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
