<mxCell id="pkt-n" value="&lt;b&gt;Candidate statuses&lt;/b&gt;: candidate → investigating → trial → adopted | rejected. The relevance check only sees the tool evaluation and the system context, never raw web content. A rejected candidate keeps its reason, so the same tool is not proposed again without new evidence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Code decides&lt;/b&gt; the gateway &quot;New candidate?&quot;: the component must be one of the system context, a tool listed under &lt;i&gt;In use&lt;/i&gt; or adopted is in use, a listed or rejected tool is never added again (the list tool only adds rows)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="600" width="720" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
