<mxCell id="pkx-n" value="&lt;b&gt;Conflicts.&lt;/b&gt; A file whose current hash is neither the pre-run nor the post-run hash was changed after the run: it is skipped (a skip lists the reason). &lt;b&gt;Not covered:&lt;/b&gt; app DB, learning gateway job store, Open Notebook content, messages already sent. Applied twice, a restore plans nothing the second time." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;spacing=8;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="pkx-Lz"><mxGeometry x="320" y="12" width="450" height="106" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
