<mxCell id="pkd-dc" value="Description cache (app DB):&lt;br&gt;lookup by hash, store after describe" style="shape=datastore;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=middle;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=middle;labelPosition=left;align=right;" vertex="1" parent="pkd-La"><mxGeometry x="295" y="610" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pkd-dt" value="Timing table (app DB):&lt;br&gt;seconds per image, seed of the next run" style="shape=datastore;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=middle;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=middle;labelPosition=right;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="pkd-La"><mxGeometry x="1165" y="610" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pkd-n" value="&lt;b&gt;Two model phases, one switch, never interleaved:&lt;/b&gt; the text items run first on qwen3.5-9b-mlx, then the images on gemma-4-12b (the text model may be unloaded in between). The judge is not used in production runs. The images get the time that is left of the cycle after the text items; the 300 s timeout bounds an overshoot to one image. A deferred image has no triage row and its entry stays in the INBOX list, first in line for the next run." style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;top=0;bottom=0;right=0;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="pkd-La"><mxGeometry x="650" y="590" width="470" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
